DriveTest est le seul logiciel qui vous permet de vous entraîner au passage du test psychotechnique du permis de conduire. Les tests psychotechniques sont obligatoires pour récupérer votre permis de conduire après annulation ou suspension pour un délai égal ou supérieur à 6 mois.
DriveTest est basé sur le test actuel et vous permet de vous entraîner de façon réaliste au test. un entraînement avant le passage du test psychotechnique améliorera vos chances de passage.
En achetant un crédit, vous avez la possibilité de passer ces tests une fois. Après le passage de chaque test vous allez voir vos résultats, ainsi qu’après le passage de tous les tests vous allez voir votre résultat final, mais qu’à titre indicatif.
Il est important que le son soit allumé lors de votre entraînement.
DriveTest inclut quatre tests
- test de Lahy - test de stabilité des mains;
- chronoscope - test qui mesure les réflexes;
- test des voitures - test de coordination motrice;
- test VCM - test d’attention.
Le test psychotechnique du permis de conduire est obligatoire afin de récupérer le permis de conduire annulé ou suspendu pour un délai égal ou supérieur à 6 mois.

Mobile application to simplify stock management and inventory control, through barcode reading.

// AGILE INVENTORY MANAGEMENT PROCESS
Records by reading barcodes through the device camera or scanner, when applicable, with association of the respective amount.

// ACCURACY IN INVENTORY CONTROL
Option for reading only the existing products in database, with the possibility of validation of the amount value.

// SIMPLICITY IN TAX OBLIGATIONS
With direct integration to ETPOS customers, this application uses the XML format defined by tributary and customs Portuguese authority, with fiscal number association, in order to facilitate compliance with the inventory reporting requirement.

// INCREASE PRODUCTIVITY
Export records in CSV and XML formats.

KIT Scenarist will allow you to have at hand all your screenplays. You can write down ideas, work out dialogues of characters, or describe actions without leaving the hammock. Send the script to the editor by mail during a trip on the subway. And even edit projects at the same time as your co-authors from different parts of the globe.

Features:
• creation of projects on the device and in the cloud service (ability to work with KIT Scenarist's cloud is an additional service);
• fill basic information about the script (script name, title page, logline, and synopsis);
• create lists of characters and locations and fill their descriptions;
• create text notes on the project with the ability to group notes by folders within each project;
• work with a ​screenplay in corkboard mode;
• viewing screenplay text and editing it in accordance with industry standards;
• view the list of scenes and navigate the text of the script;
• import scripts from the fdx, fountain, docx and kitsp formats from any installed application (mail, iCloud, Dropbox etc.);
• export notes and scripts to pdf, fdx, fountain docx and kitsp formats in any of the installed applications (mail, iCloud, Dropbox etc.).

Mobile application KIT Scenarist is only one of the components of a fully-featured studio for working on screenplays KIT Scenarist. Look to our website, where you can meet with other useful tools for creating stories that will help raise your productivity to a new level!
